WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:10.763
Once upon a time, there was a very kind girl.

2
00:00:10.764 --> 00:00:13.475
Her name was Ella.

3
00:00:13.476 --> 00:00:17.580
She lived happily with her father.

4
00:00:17.581 --> 00:00:20.969
Ella had fine clothes and jewelry.

5
00:00:20.970 --> 00:00:25.566
She had a big room with a warm, cozy bed.

6
00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:35.754
And there was always plenty of food.

7
00:00:35.755 --> 00:00:41.768
One day Ella and her father were walking in town.

8
00:00:41.769 --> 00:00:46.556
Wonderful smells came from the bakery.

9
00:00:46.557 --> 00:00:50.731
"Let's get a treat," Father said.

10
00:00:50.732 --> 00:00:58.973
Ella saw a young beggar sitting in the town square.

11
00:00:58.974 --> 00:01:02.337
"That poor boy," Ella said.

12
00:01:02.338 --> 00:01:05.750
"Father, can we please get something for him?"

13
00:01:05.751 --> 00:01:08.180
Father smiled warmly.

14
00:01:08.181 --> 00:01:12.360
"You are very kind, Ella."

15
00:01:12.361 --> 00:01:22.738
Father bought some bread.

16
00:01:22.739 --> 00:01:27.447
Ella gave it to the boy.

17
00:01:27.448 --> 00:01:34.789
"Thank you, miss," the boy said.

18
00:01:34.790 --> 00:01:40.960
A few days later, Ella saw Father in the garden.

19
00:01:40.961 --> 00:01:43.781
"You look happy, Father," she said.

20
00:01:43.782 --> 00:01:48.566
Father laughed. "I have exciting news!"

21
00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:51.607
"I met a lovely lady," Father said.

22
00:01:51.608 --> 00:01:53.709
"We're going to get married!"

23
00:01:53.710 --> 00:02:01.622
Ella gasped. "Father, I'm so happy for you!"

24
00:02:01.623 --> 00:02:08.609
A week later Father got married.

25
00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:11.742
Ella's new stepmother had two daughters.

26
00:02:11.743 --> 00:02:14.735
The older daughter was tall and thin.

27
00:02:14.736 --> 00:02:23.789
The younger one was short and plump.

28
00:02:23.790 --> 00:02:27.825
"It's nice to meet you!" Ella said.

29
00:02:27.826 --> 00:02:31.199
The two daughters smiled.

30
00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:33.111
So did their mother.

31
00:02:33.112 --> 00:02:39.611
But there was a nasty look in her eyes.

